<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Vilnius Guide: 12 places – Užupis, Gediminas Tower, KGB Museum, Trakai &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Gediminas Tower</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come at sunset and take the footpath up. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>25.29068,54.68676,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Užupis</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Read the constitution on the wall and have a coffee in the district. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>25.29938,54.68128,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Vilnius Old Town</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Drift into courtyards and side streets. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>25.28562,54.68285,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Cathedral &amp; Cathedral Square</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Turn around three times on the Stebuklas stone and make a wish. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>25.28779,54.68589,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Gate of Dawn (Aušros Vartai)</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Be respectful and dress modestly. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>25.28956,54.67431,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Vilnius University &amp; courtyards</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Walk through the courtyards and climb the bell tower. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>25.28783,54.68282,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. KGB Museum</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>25.27069,54.68802,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Hill of Crosses</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>25.29755,54.68674,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Trakai – island water castle</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Take the train and try kibinai. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>24.93392,54.65273,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Three Crosses Hill &amp; viewpoint</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go up at sunset. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/vilnius/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>25.29755,54.68674,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
